 a practice session\, it is a live and public rehearsal! It is a chance to 
 see the artistry of planning a performance up close.\n\nThe dance group 
 will be moving throughout the library rehearsing from 6:00 p.m. to 7:45 
 p.m. Explore your library and find us! Whether you're browsing the stacks 
