SUMMARY:LEGO Challenge! - Super Cleanup
DESCRIPTION:Welcome to LEGO Challenge!\n\nJoin us as we explore the world 
 of STEAM through various LEGO Education Projects.\n\nThis month we will be 
 testing the efficiency of two different grabber designs and determine the 
 best design!\n\nThese activities are intended for 3rd - 6th graders. 
