BEGIN:VEVENT
DTSTART:20260521T203000Z
DTEND:20260521T220000Z
DTSTAMP:20260521T000000Z
SUMMARY:Every Brilliant Thing at Durham County Library By PlayMakers Repertory Company
DESCRIPTION:REGISTER HERE\n\n \n\nIn this solo performance\, a person 
 reflects on their life and the hope that sustained them. By Duncan 
 Macmillan with Jonny Donahoe.\n\nStay following the performance for a 
 special second act of community discussion facilitated by artists and 
 mental health clinicians.\n\nThis immersive experience blends comedy\, 
 improv\, and audience interaction to tell one individual’s story of 
 growing up in the shadow of their mother’s struggle with suicidal 
 depression while learning to grapple with their own journey and life 
 experiences. Surprisingly charming and delightful\, “Every Brilliant 
 Thing” provides a life-affirming jolt of humanism\, reminding us that 
 hope comes from life's smallest miracles.
LOCATION:Main Children's Programming Room\, Main Library (300 N. Roxboro St)
ORGANIZER;CN="Celeste Holtzmann":MAILTO:choltzmann@dconc.gov
CATEGORIES:
UID:LibCal-14288-16936037
URL:https://durhamcountylibrary.libcal.com/event/16936037
END:VEVENT
