SUMMARY:Drawing Club
DESCRIPTION:Join us as we go back to the basics! For May and June\, we will 
 learn how to access The Great Courses and work through "How to Draw." Each 
 week\, we will watch a different video and put what we learned into 
 practice. Please bring pencils and a sketchbook or email 
 dpeterson@dconc.gov if you need supplies. \n\nRegistration is not required 
 but is encouraged. \n
