SUMMARY:Preschool STEAM Storytime: Let's Learn About Fireflies!
DESCRIPTION:Preschoolers (ages 3-5 years) and their caregivers are welcome 
 to join Ms. Natalie for a STEAM (Science\, Technology\, Engineering\, 
 Arts\, and Mathematics) storytime! On the 1st and 3rd Monday of every 
 month\, we will explore a different STEAM topic with stories\, songs\, and 
 a hands-on activity.\n\nSince it is currently firefly season in North 
 Carolina\, we will learn all about fireflies and create our own using 
 plastic eggs\, LED tea lights\, cardstock paper\, googly eyes\, and pipe 
 cleaners!\n\nRegistration is required.\n\nIf you have any questions\, 
 please contact us @ 919-560-8592.
