 3D Design - Wednesday\, June 3rd\, 4-5pm\n\n\n	Learn about the basics of 3D 
 printing and how to create your own design.\n\n\n3D Printing Orientation 
 Part 2: Printing Designs - Wednesday\,  June 10th\, 4-5pm\n\n\n	Learn about 
 our specific 3D printers and the software you use to send a print.\n\n\n 
