SUMMARY:You're Invited to... Oscar the Grouch's Birthday Party!
DESCRIPTION:Do you know Oscar the Grouch from Sesame Street? If so\, guess 
 what?! You're invited to his (belated) birthday party!\n\nYouths ages 5-11 
 can celebrate by joining Ms. Natalie for some crafting: make your own Oscar 
 the Grouch puppet\, create your own pet worm (like Oscar's pet worm\, 
 Slimey)\, or design a birthday card for Oscar! Gummy worms (in honor of 
 Slimey) will be provided as a snack\, too. Although we won't be celebrating 
 on Sesame Street\, we are sure to have a great time at the library! 
 \n\nRegistration is required.\n\nIf you have any questions\, please contact 
 us @ 919-560-8592.
LOCATION:Southwest Regional - Children's Programming Room\, Southwest Regional Library (3605 Shannon Rd)
ORGANIZER;CN="Natalie Perez":MAILTO:natperez@dconc.gov
CATEGORIES:Arts & Crafts, Summer Reading
