BEGIN:VEVENT
DTSTART:20260609T213000Z
DTEND:20260609T233000Z
DTSTAMP:20260609T000000Z
SUMMARY:"For You From Deb B Vu" Film Screening
DESCRIPTION:\n\nPlease join us for a special screening of four IronWorx 
 Media comedies and one really deep drama written\, directed\, and produced 
 by local filmmaker Deb B Vu - with a whole lot of help from her 
 friends!\n\nPlease register. Suitable for ages 13 and 
 up.\n\n\n\nAgenda\n\n\n\n\n\nDateCenter Episode 1 (8 minutes)\nDateCenter 
 is like Sportscenter but for dating situations! Anchor Anita Long-Johnson 
 commentates on a couple's fight. Who will win this petty-ass 
 argument?\n\nWhile We Were Out (30 minutes)\nA night out. An ensemble TV 
 pilot follows 20  characters as they intersect in various ways at Downtown 
 Durham's Bar Virgile.\n\nIt's Your Funeral (12 minutes)\nA cousin confronts 
 her abuser's corpse before his funeral. TRIGGER WARNING: reference to 
 S.A.\n\nHaunted by You (8 minutes)\nAn unlucky dead dude gets summoned to 
 the real world with a simple utterance of his name. Though his mom and 
 girlfriend can't see him\, a blast from the past does and decides to help 
 him cope with his new existence.\n\nVuberVision (50 minutes)\nAn original 
 sketch comedy show\, produced right here in the Triangle with local cast 
 and crew who all volunteered! The show's theme surrounds around what you'd 
 see on television like quirky sitcoms\, a game show\, the news\, a talk 
 show\, a late-night infomercial\, commercials\, and many more!\n\n
LOCATION:North Meeting Room - Full Room\, North Regional Library (221 Milton Rd)
ORGANIZER;CN="Emily Tobias":MAILTO:etobias@dconc.gov
CATEGORIES:Durham, Movie
UID:LibCal-14288-16709821
URL:https://durhamcountylibrary.libcal.com/event/16709821
END:VEVENT
