SUMMARY:Mousehunt Screening w/ Mouse Hunting!
DESCRIPTION:"I don't think we're dealing with an ordinary mouse!"\n\nDo you 
 remember that one movie from your childhood that was kind of darkly bizarre 
 and quirky? Well now it's time to share it with your kids! Join us for a 
 special showing of Gore Verbinksi's absurdist family flick\, Mousehunt! 
 Come for a great whacky movie\, but stay for our mouse hunting games and 
 coloring activities.\n\n \n\nThe film runs at 98 minutes and is rated PG 
 for some mild language\, cartoonish violence and some suggestive 
 references. Registration encouraged but not required!
